title: LinOTP Tokens %s
agents: linotp_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Reports token counts for one LinOTP realm (/monitoring/tokens), as a
 service directly on the host running the LinOTP REST special agent:
 total tokens and total users with at least one token assigned, both
 also exported as performance data for trending.

 Goes CRIT/WARN only if upper/lower levels configured via the "LinOTP
 token counts" ruleset are breached (none are set by default, e.g. to
 get an early warning before a license limit is reached, or to notice an
 unexpected bulk revocation) or if the underlying data could not be
 read; otherwise OK.

item:
 The realm name, e.g. "corp.example.com".

discovery:
 One "LinOTP Tokens <realm>" service per realm reported by the LinOTP
 REST special agent.
